      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/1559-2d-entry-below-stock\n\nResolved by hand (DELTA):\n- crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs (Pocket arm): keep main's rest_pocket /\n  pocket_entered choice, and keep this PR's carried-stock re-generation; the\n  re-generation now runs the same chosen generator with the entries lifted.\n- crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket.rs: take main's (pass emission moved\n  to pocket_emit.rs by #2154); apply this PR's entry_top in pocket_emit.rs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
